sequenceDiagram
    participant Agent as AI Agent<br/>(MCP Client)
    participant Transport as Transport Layer<br/>stdio / SSE / streamable-http
    participant OIDC as OIDC Auth Middleware<br/>(ASGI)
    participant MCP as FastMCP Server<br/>Port 8000
    participant Plugin as Plugin Handler<br/>(pluggy)
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over Agent,K8s: Flow 1: Authenticated MCP Tool Call (OIDC Enabled)
    Agent->>Transport: MCP CallToolRequest
    Transport->>OIDC: HTTP Request<br/>Authorization: Bearer <JWT>
    OIDC->>OIDC: Validate JWT<br/>(JWT verification or TokenReview)
    OIDC->>MCP: Authenticated Request<br/>(user identity extracted)
    MCP->>MCP: SubjectAccessReview<br/>(per-tool RBAC filter)
    MCP->>Plugin: Dispatch to plugin tool handler
    Plugin->>K8s: API Request<br/>(forwarded token or impersonation)<br/>TLS 1.2+
    K8s-->>Plugin: API Response
    Plugin-->>MCP: Tool Result
    MCP-->>OIDC: MCP Response
    OIDC-->>Transport: HTTP Response
    Transport-->>Agent: MCP CallToolResult

    Note over Agent,K8s: Flow 2: Unauthenticated stdio (Single-User Mode)
    Agent->>Transport: MCP CallToolRequest (stdio)
    Transport->>MCP: Direct (no HTTP)
    MCP->>Plugin: Dispatch (all tools visible)
    Plugin->>K8s: API Request<br/>(rhoai-mcp ServiceAccount)<br/>TLS 1.2+
    K8s-->>Plugin: API Response
    Plugin-->>MCP: Tool Result
    MCP-->>Transport: MCP Response
    Transport-->>Agent: MCP CallToolResult

    Note over Agent,K8s: Flow 3: Health Check (Always Unauthenticated)
    Agent->>Transport: GET /health
    Transport->>MCP: Bypass OIDC middleware
    MCP-->>Transport: 200 OK
    Transport-->>Agent: Health Response

    Note over Agent,K8s: Flow 4: Platform CRD Operations
    Plugin->>K8s: Create/Watch InferenceService<br/>(serving.kserve.io)
    K8s-->>Plugin: InferenceService status
    Plugin->>K8s: CRUD Notebook<br/>(kubeflow.org)
    K8s-->>Plugin: Notebook response
    Plugin->>K8s: CRUD TrainJob<br/>(trainer.kubeflow.org)
    K8s-->>Plugin: TrainJob response
    Plugin->>K8s: CRUD DSPA<br/>(datasciencepipelinesapplications.opendatahub.io)
    K8s-->>Plugin: DSPA response
